' 项目：DanmakuStream
' 版本：v1.0
' 作者：E
' 日期：2026-08-26
' 对应用例/需求：UC06 个人视频资料库 - 系统级顺序图

@startuml SYS-SEQ06
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2c3e50
    ActorBorderColor #2c3e50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2c3e50
    ParticipantBorderColor #34495e
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ecf0f1
    ActorBackgroundColor #3498db
    ActorFontColor #ffffff
    BoxBorderColor #95a5a6
    BoxBackgroundColor #f8f9fa
}

actor "普通用户" as User
box "DanmakuStream 系统边界" #f8f9fa
    participant "前端浏览器\n(UserLibraryPage.vue)" as Frontend
    participant "localStorage\n(本地存储)" as Storage
    participant "API网关\n(Gin Router)" as Gateway
    participant "engagement-service\n(互动微服务)" as Engagement
    participant "content-service\n(内容微服务)" as Content
    participant "user-service\n(用户微服务)" as UserSvc
end box

autonumber

== 主流程：查看历史记录 ==
User -> Frontend: 点击「历史记录」菜单
Frontend -> Storage: getUserLibraryRecords('history')
Storage --> Frontend: 返回本地历史记录列表
note right of Frontend
  // TODO: 代码中未找到后端 history API 实现
  当前UC06历史记录仅使用localStorage本地存储
end note
Frontend --> User: 展示历史记录列表（含播放进度）

== 扩展流程：未登录查看历史 ==
alt 用户未登录
    Frontend -> Frontend: 检查登录状态(authStore.isLoggedIn=false)
    Frontend --> User: 展示本地历史记录
    note right
        未登录时数据仅存本地浏览器
        不进行后端同步
    end note
end

== 主流程：保存播放进度 ==
User -> Frontend: 播放视频（timeupdate事件）
activate Frontend
Frontend -> Frontend: 监听播放时间变化(currentTime)
Frontend -> Gateway: GET /videos/:id (加载视频详情)
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Content: 调用DetailLogic.Detail()
activate Content
Content --> Gateway: 返回VideoInfo(duration, status='approved')
deactivate Content
Gateway --> Frontend: 返回视频详情
deactivate Gateway

== 页面卸载时保存进度 ==
Frontend -> Frontend: onUnmounted() 触发 saveHistory()
Frontend -> Frontend: 计算 progress = currentTime/duration * 100
Frontend -> Storage: upsertUserLibraryRecord('history', video, progress)
Storage --> Frontend: 写入成功
note right of Storage
  Key: danmaku:user-library:history
  限制：最多保存80条记录
end note
deactivate Frontend

== 主流程：点赞视频（间接加入资料库） ==
User -> Frontend: 点击「点赞」按钮
Frontend -> Frontend: ensureLogin() 检查登录
alt 已登录
    Frontend -> Gateway: POST /videos/:id/like (需Bearer Token)
    activate Gateway
    Gateway -> UserSvc: AuthMiddleware 验证Token
    activate UserSvc
    UserSvc --> Gateway: 返回userID
    deactivate UserSvc
    Gateway -> Engagement: 执行LikeHandler()
    activate Engagement
    Engagement -> Engagement: 检查Like记录是否存在
    alt 已点赞（取消点赞）
        Engagement -> Engagement: DB.Delete(Like)
        Engagement --> Gateway: 返回 {liked: false}
    else 未点赞（新增点赞）
        Engagement -> Engagement: DB.Create(Like)
        Engagement --> Gateway: 返回 {liked: true}
    end
    deactivate Engagement
    Gateway --> Frontend: 返回点赞结果
    deactivate Gateway

    alt 点赞成功(liked=true)
        Frontend -> Storage: upsertUserLibraryRecord('liked', video)
        Storage --> Frontend: 本地点赞列表已更新
    else 取消点赞(liked=false)
        Frontend -> Storage: removeUserLibraryRecord('liked', videoId)
        Storage --> Frontend: 本地点赞列表已移除
    end
    Frontend --> User: 更新点赞按钮状态
else 未登录
    Frontend --> User: ElMessage.warning('请先登录')
    Frontend -> Frontend: router.push('/login')
end

== 主流程：收藏视频（间接加入资料库） ==
User -> Frontend: 点击「收藏」按钮
Frontend -> Frontend: ensureLogin() 检查登录
alt 已登录
    Frontend -> Gateway: POST /videos/:id/collect (需Bearer Token)
    activate Gateway
    Gateway -> Engagement: 执行CollectHandler()
    activate Engagement
    Engagement -> Engagement: 检查Collect记录是否存在
    alt 已收藏（取消收藏）
        Engagement -> Engagement: DB.Delete(Collect)
        Engagement --> Gateway: 返回 {collected: false}
    else 未收藏（新增收藏）
        Engagement -> Engagement: DB.Create(Collect)
        Engagement --> Gateway: 返回 {collected: true}
    end
    deactivate Engagement
    Gateway --> Frontend: 返回收藏结果
    deactivate Gateway

    alt 收藏成功(collected=true)
        Frontend -> Storage: upsertUserLibraryRecord('collections', video)
        Storage --> Frontend: 本地收藏列表已更新
    else 取消收藏(collected=false)
        Frontend -> Storage: removeUserLibraryRecord('collections', videoId)
        Storage --> Frontend: 本地收藏列表已移除
    end
    Frontend --> User: 更新收藏按钮状态
end

== 主流程：删除单条资料库记录 ==
User -> Frontend: 点击某条记录的「删除」按钮
Frontend -> Storage: removeUserLibraryRecord(kind, videoId)
Storage --> Frontend: 已从本地移除
note right of Storage
  // TODO: 代码中未找到后端删除历史记录 API
  当前仅删除本地localStorage
end note
Frontend -> Frontend: loadRecords() 刷新列表
Frontend --> User: 记录已从列表中消失

== 主流程：清空资料库记录 ==
User -> Frontend: 点击「清空」按钮
Frontend -> Frontend: ElMessageBox.confirm 二次确认
alt 用户确认清空
    Frontend -> Storage: clearUserLibraryRecords(kind)
    Storage --> Frontend: 本地数据已清空
    note right of Storage
      // TODO: 代码中未找到后端清空历史记录 API
      当前仅清空本地localStorage
    end note
    Frontend -> Frontend: loadRecords() 刷新列表
    Frontend --> User: 展示空状态(暂无记录)
else 用户取消
    Frontend --> User: 关闭确认框，无变化
end

== 异常：记录不存在 ==
alt 加载视频详情时视频不存在
    Frontend -> Gateway: GET /videos/:id
    Gateway -> Content: DetailLogic.Detail()
    Content --> Gateway: 返回 error "视频不存在"
    Gateway --> Frontend: 404 NotFound
    Frontend --> User: 展示 "视频不存在或尚未通过审核"
end

@enduml
